---
import {pathTo} from '@/lib/paths';
import Icon from '@/components/shared/Icon.astro';
---
<section class="section options-section" aria-label="Patient options"><div class="container options-grid">
  <article class="option-card"><span class="option-overline">KNOW ALL YOUR OPTIONS</span><h2>Care before the<br/><em>next big decision.</em></h2><p>Your provider can discuss conservative treatments, specialized procedures, and other options based on your evaluation.</p><div class="option-visual option-visual-journey"><div class="journey-step"><span>01</span> Evaluate</div><div class="journey-line"></div><div class="journey-step"><span>02</span> Plan</div><div class="journey-line"></div><div class="journey-step"><span>03</span> Care</div></div><a href={pathTo('/book/')} class="button-primary">Explore your options <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
  <article class="option-card"><span class="option-overline">KNOW YOUR COVERAGE</span><h2>Clarity about<br/><em>your insurance.</em></h2><p>OCA can help you request an insurance benefits review before taking the next step in care.</p><div class="option-visual insurance-visual"><span><Icon name="shield" size={35}/> Benefits review</span><span><Icon name="insurance" size={35}/> Coverage details</span><span><Icon name="check" size={35}/> Next steps</span></div><a href={pathTo('/insurance/')} class="button-primary">Verify my insurance <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
</div></section>
